ourse_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13981281/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-316621" "field" "field-3" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "16"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13981281/state.json" "file_sha256" "8c85a19be08a8c2307b20f82feb4e06633d02690ca32e6ed9deb7d6757772ebb" "basis" 886 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13981281/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-316621" "field" "field-4" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13981281/state.json" "file_sha256" "8c85a19be08a8c2307b20f82feb4e06633d02690ca32e6ed9deb7d6757772ebb" "basis" 886 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13981281/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-316621" "field" "field-4" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "32"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13981281/state.json" "file_sha256" "8c85a19be08a8c2307b20f82feb4e06633d02690ca32e6ed9deb7d6757772ebb" "basis" 886 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13981281/edb-import/verification.json"}] "sources" [{"question" "q-316617" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "The cubic polynomial $P(x)$ has roots ${x}_{1}=-4,$ ${x}_{2}=1,$ and ${x}_{3}=2,$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $3.$ Find $P(x).$\n\n$P(x)=$\n{{field-1}}${x}^{3}\\,+$\n{{field-2}}${x}^{2}\\,-$\n{{field-3}}$x\\,+$\n{{field-4}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039932/state.json" "file_sha256" "b97218003d5040869cefa9df1b40539500482f73743419ed51cf01f56c45cb9e"} {"question" "q-316617" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Since our cubic polynomial has roots ${x}_{1}=-4,$ ${x}_{2}=1,$ and ${x}_{3}=2,$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $a=3,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(x-{x}_{1})(x-{x}_{2})(x-{x}_{3}) & =3(x-(-4))(x-1)(x-2) \\\\  & =3(x+4)(x-1)(x-2)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3(x+4)(x-1)(x-2) & =3({x}^{2}+3x-4)(x-2) \\\\  & =3({x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}+3{x}^{2}-6x-4x+8) \\\\  & =3({x}^{3}+{x}^{2}-10x+8) \\\\  & =3{x}^{3}+3{x}^{2}-30x+24.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(x)=3{x}^{3}+3{x}^{2}-30x+24.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039932/state.json" "file_sha256" "b97218003d5040869cefa9df1b40539500482f73743419ed51cf01f56c45cb9e"} {"question" "q-316617" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039932/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "8787dd3d1106e68f1f6f500c294c5c0c69becc787a3f56eadd807b5847520df4"} {"question" "q-316617" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039932/state.json" "file_sha256" "b97218003d5040869cefa9df1b40539500482f73743419ed51cf01f56c45cb9e"} {"question" "q-316617" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "3"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039932/state.json" "file_sha256" "b97218003d5040869cefa9df1b40539500482f73743419ed51cf01f56c45cb9e"} {"question" "q-316617" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039932/state.json" "file_sha256" "b97218003d5040869cefa9df1b40539500482f73743419ed51cf01f56c45cb9e"} {"question" "q-316617" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "3"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039932/state.json" "file_sha256" "b97218003d5040869cefa9df1b40539500482f73743419ed51cf01f56c45cb9e"} {"question" "q-316617" "field" "field-3" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039932/state.json" "file_sha256" "b97218003d5040869cefa9df1b40539500482f73743419ed51cf01f56c45cb9e"} {"question" "q-316617" "field" "field-3" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "30"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039932/state.json" "file_sha256" "b97218003d5040869cefa9df1b40539500482f73743419ed51cf01f56c45cb9e"} {"question" "q-316617" "field" "field-4" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039932/state.json" "file_sha256" "b97218003d5040869cefa9df1b40539500482f73743419ed51cf01f56c45cb9e"} {"question" "q-316617" "field" "field-4" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "24"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039932/state.json" "file_sha256" "b97218003d5040869cefa9df1b40539500482f73743419ed51cf01f56c45cb9e"} {"question" "q-316621" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "The cubic polynomial $P(x)$ has roots ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=-4,{x}_{3}=1,$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $2.$ Find $P(x).$\n\n$P(x)=$\n{{field-1}}${x}^{3}\\,+$\n{{field-2}}${x}^{2}\\,+$\n{{field-3}}$x\\,-$\n{{field-4}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039932/state.json" "file_sha256" "b97218003d5040869cefa9df1b40539500482f73743419ed51cf01f56c45cb9e"} {"question" "q-316621" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Since our cubic polynomial has roots ${x}_{1}=-4,$ ${x}_{2}=-4,$ and ${x}_{3}=1,$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $a=2,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(x-{x}_{1})(x-{x}_{2})(x-{x}_{3}) & =2(x-(-4))(x-(-4))(x-1) \\\\  & =2(x+4)(x+4)(x-1)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2(x+4)(x+4)(x-1) & =2({x}^{2}+8x+16)(x-1) \\\\  & =2({x}^{3}-{x}^{2}+8{x}^{2}-8x+16x-16) \\\\  & =2({x}^{3}+7{x}^{2}+8x-16) \\\\  & =2{x}^{3}+14{x}^{2}+16x-32.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(x)=2{x}^{3}+14{x}^{2}+16x-32.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039932/state.json" "file_sha256" "b97218003d5040869cefa9df1b40539500482f73743419ed51cf01f56c45cb9e"} {"question" "q-316621" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039932/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "8787dd3d1106e68f1f6f500c294c5c0c69becc787a3f56eadd807b5847520df4"} {"question" "q-316621" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039932/state.json" "file_sha256" "b97218003d5040